abstract = {With the increasing demand for refined production management and the continuous advancement of intelligent manufacturing technologies in the military industry, military production management is facing increasingly complex challenges. To address these challenges, the role of MES (Manufacturing Execution System) in production line management has become increasingly important. The MES system enhances production efficiency, ensures the stability of product quality, and achieves comprehensive transparency and informatization of the production process through order management, order dispatching, production process control, real-time monitoring, data analysis, scheduling optimization, and quality control.The system utilizes SQL Server for data storage, establishing a robust data structure and database. The development environment is VS2015, and the system employs a front-end and back-end separation technology. Specifically, the front-end is designed using HTML and JavaScript, while the back-end is developed using the C# programming language. The front-end and back-end communicate in real-time through AJAX technology, and APIs are used for communication between devices. The system aims to improve the flexibility and intelligence of the production line to meet the changing demands and challenges of the manufacturing industry.},
