abstract = {This study designed and developed an AI-powered psychological resilience assessment and intervention platform for youth winter sports athletes. Utilizing multi-dimensional data collection and deep learning technologies, the platform enables real-time evaluation and personalized interventions for adolescent athletes 'psychological resilience. By integrating emotional, behavioral, and physiological data through time-series modeling and reinforcement learning algorithms, it generates precise individual profiles and dynamic intervention strategies. The system's trend tracking and early warning mechanism can proactively identify potential psychological issues and provide targeted intervention recommendations. Through systematic integration testing and functional effectiveness evaluation, the platform demonstrates outstanding performance in high-concurrency processing, real-time data handling, and personalized interventions, effectively enhancing the psychological resilience and overall mental health of young winter sports athletes.},
