address = {New York, NY, USA},
url = {https://doi.org/10.1145/3644523.3644530},
doi = {10.1145/3644523.3644530},
abstract = {The traditional physical assets management of power grid equipment has strict management measures from bidding, procurement, goods acceptance, waste materials and so on. With the increase of the pace of power grid construction, the physical assets of power grid equipment soar in an avalanche. It not only increases the work intensity of material managers, but also poses a great challenge to the existing physical equipment asset management model. To realize the lean management of physical assets of power grid equipment, improve the accuracy of physical equipment asset management, and reduce the labor intensity of material management is an urgent problem to be solved. Compared with the traditional equipment physical asset management method, the new proposed digital equipment physical asset management method realizes a non-contact mode of equipment physical asset management on the basis of establishing the digital information model of equipment physical information. It can avoid the large professional span of material demand department managers due to personnel changes or going out, lack of comprehensive understanding of equipment, or limited by the physical storage area of equipment. The inconvenient material management personnel verify the asset-related information one by one next to the equipment, which leads to the reduction of the efficiency of equipment physical asset management, improves the work efficiency of material management personnel.},
