abstract = {This study developed a psychological support guarantee system based on the mental health problems of college students. Through the multi-level system design, including psychological evaluation, early warning and intervention, psychological counseling and counseling, and data management and analysis module, the comprehensive monitoring and intervention of students' psychological status are realized. The system uses advanced algorithms, such as principal component analysis (PCA), convolutional neural network (CNN), long and short-term memory network (LSTM), and Bayesian optimization (Bayesian Optimization), to ensure the accuracy and effectiveness of the evaluation and intervention. The results of performance test and functional test show that the system is excellent in response speed, concurrent processing ability, resource use efficiency and data processing performance, and has efficient, stable and safe operation ability, which provides reliable psychological support for college students. The research shows that this system has an important application value in improving the precision and effectiveness of mental health services.},
